SAFARI SHIP

198

Included within the hull are two holding tanks with
variable environments for live specimens and a
trophy lounge that makes for a very comfortable
mess area for passengers and crew. While the ship
is streamlined and can land planetside, a launch and
ATV permit expeditions across a planets surface
without requiring the whole vessel to leave orbit.

